    "created_at": "2018-11-26T15:52:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-11-26T15:52:44Z",
    "body": "The only reason we need \"URSOBC\" is for the definition of agents (i.e., event loop), not for anything related to browsing contexts. Browsing contexts use agents to host documents in. Conflating them doesn't make logical sense.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
